{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20861","headline":"湘妃 · 李贺","name":"湘妃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"筠竹千年老不死，长伴秦娥盖湘水。\n蛮娘吟弄满寒空，九山静绿泪花红。\n离鸾别凤烟梧中，巫云蜀雨遥相通。\n幽愁秋气上青枫，凉夜波间吟古龙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20861.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20861","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}